#. ~ Description of "baldric holster"
#: data/json/items/armor/holster.json
msgid ""
"A leather harness which can hold up to six pistol-sized guns in total, "
"available for quick drawing.  Historically, similar harnesses were used by "
"pirates to carry multiple loaded flintlock pistols at once, as reloading them"
" is a lengthy process.  Activate to holster/draw a gun."
msgstr ""

